00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:02.026
I'd also love to know

00:07:02.026 --> 00:07:04.892
which of Burt Rutan's
top ten rules for success

00:07:04.892 --> 00:07:06.891
you love the most.

00:07:06.891 --> 00:07:07.842
Leave it in the comments

00:07:07.842 --> 00:07:09.491
and I'm going to join the discussion.

00:07:09.491 --> 00:07:11.034
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:07:11.034 --> 00:07:14.534
Continue to believe and I'll see you soon.

